# Commits

- English Conventional Commits.
- Types: `feat`, `fix`, `docs`, `chore`, `refactor`.
- Default scopes: `frontend` or `backend`.
- Other scopes only when it does not fit those two (`repo`, `ci`, or omit scope for pure `docs:`).

```text
feat(frontend): add month summary cards
feat(backend): create space invite endpoint
docs: update product privacy section
chore(ci): add typecheck job
```

- Prefer one logical change per commit when the user asks to commit.
- Do not commit unless the user explicitly asks.
